  m_Name: unit_830828
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  unitName: Snowtop Alpinist Alphie
  unitId: 830828
  unitNumber: 8600
  description: "One of the twelve creature candidates in a competition to be the
    best assistant for the divine Emperor Yu, Goat was small in stature, but possessed
    an altruistic heart and was always looking out for everyone.Having become a well-liked
    mountain \"spirit\" of a sort in the earthly realm where the celestial creatures
    were sent to in human guise, Alphie\u2014as the awestruck villagers named the
    little elfin being that came into their midst\u2014rather enjoyed his new home.
    The tall, snow-covered peaks and mountainous ridges evoked a sense of longing
    like never before, and he knew that he would be staying here for the long term.But
    like the fairies of folklore, beneath that childlike guise lies a far more eerie
    secret.Just as coins have two sides to them, so do the helpful elfin fairies
    of the mountain. Alphie's cartload of discarded items, some weathered but lovingly
    polished to a shine, invariably shows up whenever a lost traveler faces deepening
    dusk in one of the many twisting valleys. With bright eyes and a jaunty step,
    Alphie ensures their survival with timely aid\u2014perhaps a warm coat or a pickaxe
    for a rock slide. Those who notice do not ask why the coat has the nostalgic
    scent, or why the pickaxe has a small name carved into its base; in a crisis,
    any help is welcome.At the end of another night rescuing the lost, Alphie always
    makes sure to tip his hat to the little rock mounds every few roads or so. To
    him, he was only a conduit for these tools; those who had moved on had no need
    of them, after all.For just like the mountain fairies, Alphie looks after more
    than just the living\u2014he helps the dead look after them too."
  summonDesc: Hiya! Ya need anything, let me know anytime, ya hear?<br>Don't matter
    if it's past or present or future!<br>Ya can always count on me!
  fusionDesc: Shucks, that's fer me?<br>Ya didn't have ta do that,<br>but it's nice
    knowing people look out for ya!
  evoDesc: Ever see the sun from the mountaintop?<br>Makes you think about the wonders
    of nature, huh?<br>You humans can be wonderful too, if ya tried.
  element: 3
  rarity: 7
